WEBVTT

00:03:26.502 --> 00:03:30.787
"I'm not weird. I've read
Steven J.'s biography.

00:03:30.811 --> 00:03:34.670
Oh my goodness --
I'm not that person. I am nice.

00:03:34.694 --> 00:03:36.028
I am normal.

00:03:36.052 --> 00:03:39.850
I'm a nice, normal person,
and nice, normal people --

00:03:41.003 --> 00:03:42.550
don't have passion."

00:03:42.574 --> 00:03:43.598
(Laughter)

00:03:43.622 --> 00:03:46.123
"Ah, but I still want a great career.

00:03:46.147 --> 00:03:48.076
I'm not prepared to pursue my passion,

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.631
so I know what I'm going to do,

00:03:49.655 --> 00:03:51.519
because I have a solution.

00:03:51.543 --> 00:03:52.995
I have a strategy.

00:03:53.019 --> 00:03:55.433
It's the one Mommy
and Daddy told me about.

00:03:55.457 --> 00:03:58.512
Mommy and Daddy told me
that if I worked hard,

00:03:58.536 --> 00:04:00.290
I'd have a good career.